# chorus CEC golden vector: LPCM, 2 channels, 48 kHz, 16 bit: the only descriptor the hub reports.
#
# Committed, never written by a test. Rust-only by declaration (CEC runs on the Linux hub
# alone): crates/cec/tests/fixtures.rs decodes these bytes to report_short_audio_descriptor_lpcm.fields and encodes the
# fields back to these bytes. Format: whitespace separated hex bytes, '#' starts a comment.

# header: initiator 5, destination 0
50

# opcode: report_short_audio_descriptor
A3

# operands
09 04 01
